WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.320
In the palace

00:03.400 --> 00:05.240
Find a palace maid with good looks

00:05.320 --> 00:06.987
Enfeoff her as Princess Yongxing

00:07.480 --> 00:09.640
Have the lady-in-waiting teach her etiquette quickly

00:09.720 --> 00:10.960
Yes

00:13.000 --> 00:43.000
In the sixteenth year of Longwu, Princess Yongxing departed Dingzhou for Yanjing. The sovereign of Yan and Qi took issue with her not being a true imperial princess, granting her only the status of consort, and wrote to the Xuan Emperor reducing the promised warhorses.

